# sapintegrationsuite_service_endpoints (Data Source)

Lists the service endpoints SAP generates for deployed content with an HTTP-based sender
adapter: their entry point URLs and API definition links. Endpoints exist only while the
content is deployed, so there is no resource for them. `name` and `protocol` filter on SAP's
side; without them, every endpoint is returned. Results are sorted by name and protocol.

The data source has no reference to a deployment. Add `depends_on` on the deployment resource,
or it may read before the flow is deployed.

**Status:** read_only. Backed by `ServiceEndpoints` of the Integration Content API.

No match returns an empty `endpoints` list, not an error.

